@ui @brand-detail
Feature: Brand detail page

    @smoke
    Scenario: As a user, I should see Afnan information and its perfume list, when I navigate to the Afnan brand detail page

    Scenario: As a user, I should navigate to a perfume detail page showing Afnan as its brand, when I click a perfume card on the brand detail page

    Scenario: As a user, I should see the official brand website open in a new tab, when I click the official website link

    Scenario: As a user, I should see a not-found or error state without a broken perfume list, when I navigate to an invalid brand slug

    Scenario: As a user, I should see brand information and perfumes without horizontal overflow, when I open the Afnan detail page at 375 pixels
